I only did the first sentence: I had to watch the video, write down the
English subtitle, and then translate that into Lojban. I'm sure our
translations are similar, this is only for comparison.

Clouds - mankind has been living in their hitherto innocuous shadow for
ages.
dilnu .i loi remna caba'o jmive ni'a lo ze'e na ckape go'i ctino ti'u za'u
cedra

